cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Counterexamples to Written on the Wall II conjecture #138"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
authors:
  - name: "yutitan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yutitan/wowii-conjecture-138"
url: "https://github.com/yutitan/wowii-conjecture-138"
abstract: >-
  Explicit trees that violate conjecture #138 of Written on the Wall II
  (Graffiti.pc): path(G) >= (2+u(G))*dist_min(M(G^2)).  The smallest
  counterexamples are three trees on 18 vertices; none exists with fewer
  vertices.  Includes a standard-library verification script and an exhaustive
  search over unlabeled trees.
keywords:
  - graph theory
  - path number
  - independent set
  - Graffiti.pc
  - Written on the Wall
  - counterexample
license: MIT
